{
  "$comment": "The one page inventory for janaka.me. scripts/site_lib.py reads it for the sitemap, the content index, the feed, JSON-LD breadcrumbs, llms.txt and the public JSON. A page outside the crawl roots is invisible until it is listed under pages. kind: 'landing' pages go in the sitemap only; 'resource' pages also go in the content index, feed (blog/academy/lab), search, llms.txt and the WebMCP tools. aliases maps a near-duplicate file to the page that is canonical for it: the alias carries rel=canonical to its target and stays out of every derived output.",
